    "identifier": "jugo-hellfire-jets",
    "description": "<p>As part of moving, you may cast this jutsu, forming jets at your back. Until the beginning of your next turn, your speed increases by 20ft and you gain a flight speed equal to your speed.</p>\n<p>For the duration, you may choose to float up to 1 foot off the ground, being immune to difficult terrain and any special terrain you encounter.</p>\n<p>Amplify: By spending 2 Natural Energy as part of this jutsu’s casting, and then 1 Nature Energy at the beginning of each of your turns, you can extend this jutsu’s duration by 1 round.</p>",
